<title>USA: Ultra Pac names William Howard as COO.</title>
<headline>Ultra Pac names William Howard as COO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultra Pac Inc said Monday it named William Howard as chief operating officer, with overall responsibility for all manufacturing operations, sales and marketing, finance and human resources and management information systems.</p>
<p>Howard succeeds Thomas Rains, a member of Ultra Pac's board, who has been acting chief operating officer since October.</p>
<p>Howard has been an executive at GE Capital, a unit of General Electric Co, since early 1995, most recently as senior vice president, business development.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
